          "note": "Heihoujin is another practitioner noun; Idem refers to the preceding fencer definition, not to the art itself."
        },
        {
          "id": "c1-l015",
          "runs": [
            {
              "typeface": "roman",
              "text": "Feifǒxa."
            },
            {
              "typeface": "italic",
              "text": " Idem."
            }
          ],
          "note": "Heihousha is likewise a fencer, with -sha marking the person. Preserve the printed sequence rather than modernizing all three synonyms."
