          "note": "Heifuku here denotes worn, torn clothing, as roto e velho specifies; a modern gloss of ordinary dress would miss this entry's sense."
        },
        {
          "id": "c1-l017",
          "runs": [
            {
              "typeface": "roman",
              "text": "Feigi. Tairacana tçuchi."
            },
            {
              "typeface": "italic",
              "text": " Terra praina."
            }
